WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Never thought of it in the future

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,600
My powers can still win

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,600
I know this body is also a person with special abilities

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,040
Several of your companions have had their souls reshaped by me

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,320
These souls will feel the pain I inflict on them

6
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,000
If you come closer I will let them

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,570
let me leave

8
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:19,570
This will ensure they don't die
